    {
      "id": "1455747204110094479",
      "type": "Default",
      "timestamp": "2025-12-30T21:19:39.935-05:00",
      "timestampEdited": "2025-12-31T12:41:44.489-05:00",
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Experimental Mode - City Driving\n\nLateral is very good. Almost like Plan Plus V1! It can recenter quickly and smoothly. Lane changes are smooth but a bit slow to move over. Lateral is better than V3. \n\nLong is less gap than V5 but not as responsive as V2. But good progress. It does creep past the red light at the cross walk line where I need to brake. This was also present with V5.",
      "author": {
        "id": "455222421847277588",
        "name": "kenichi.sama",
        "discriminator": "0000",
        "nickname": "Kenichi",
        "color": "#979C9F",
        "isBot": false,
        "roles": [
          {
