    {
      "id": "1456086678417707111",
      "type": "Default",
      "timestamp": "2025-12-31T19:48:36.917-05:00",
      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Totally agree — I had almost the exact same experience.\n\nI’ve never driven a Tesla myself, so I didn’t realize FSD struggled with similar issues as well. Interesting to hear that it’s not unique to comma.\n\nThe comma team has mentioned before that they’re a couple of years behind Tesla, but when you think about the difference in available GPU compute and the onboard hardware — Tesla having something like ~50 TOPS versus comma being in a completely different class — it’s honestly kind of magical how close comma has managed to get.\n\nThe progress they’ve made given those constraints is pretty incredible.",
      "author": {
        "id": "376928180692320258",
        "name": ".nickwilde",
        "discriminator": "0000",
        "nickname": "NickWilde",
