    {
      "id": "1456455305562161203",
      "type": "Default",
      "timestamp": "2026-01-01T20:13:24.477-05:00",
      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Posted this on the SP forum, bit posting it here as well. Not sure where best place is for model feedback. \n\nI just drove my Ford Ranger.with WMIv6. Horrible experience. First time I've been frightened to let either SP or OP drive. Terrible ping pong. Not all the way to the edge of the lane, but constant rocking of wheel back and forth. It drove like a human…if that human had a couple whiskeys and a six pack.\n\nWorst of all, when I took control of the wheel through a round-abput with MADS.still engaged, the C4 rebooted on me. Granted I'm new to OP/SP, but I've never had that happen before. Can a driving model crash the system?\n\nI'd be happy to link the logs of the drive. Someone let me know if I do that on the OP Discord or on this SP forum. I have a bookmark at see of the wobbling, but it was throughout. And hopefully, the logs show what caused the crash and reboot.",
      "author": {
        "id": "280878469586616321",
        "name": "the_bonus_mission",
